WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.339 --> 00:00:04.750
If you let it, this world will take you.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:11.000
If you do not persevere and take risks to
pursue what you want to do and instead, submit

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.330
to fears and uncertainties, this world will
deprive you of your life and decide what to

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.770
do with you, for you.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:26.070
It will put you in the passenger seat and
find someone or something else more capable

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:29.130
of doing the driving.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:35.510
In life, there is no risk in risking it all
to become who you want to be and to do what

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:37.570
you want to do.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.480
The only real risk is if you never take it.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:48.430
Because if you do not face the fears, challenges,
and potential setbacks on the path of doing

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:55.620
what you want and achieving what you believe
in, life will be nothing more than doing things

00:00:55.620 --> 00:01:00.480
you don’t want to do for things that you
don’t believe in.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:04.720
You will feel sedentary in a life that requires
movement.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:10.990
You will feel helpless in a life that requires
a sense of self-control.

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:17.250
You will feel as though you not only failed
to reach your true purpose and ideals, but

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:20.409
that you failed to even try.

00:01:20.409 --> 00:01:26.020
You will feel weak and incomplete, and you
will die without knowing what you could have

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:30.600
done and who you ultimately could have been.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:38.039
And with that, you would already be as good
as dead long before death arrives.

00:01:38.039 --> 00:01:44.369
In the case of striving towards your goals,
beliefs, passions, and legacy, what are you

00:01:44.369 --> 00:01:48.209
really risking by taking risks?

00:01:48.209 --> 00:01:54.709
If you are not yet excited or fulfilled by
your life, than you essentially have nothing

00:01:54.709 --> 00:01:56.389
to lose.

00:01:56.389 --> 00:01:59.419
Your sense of life is incomplete.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:03.289
Your sense of purpose is unfilled.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:10.959
You have no rational choice other than to
do anything and everything to fill it.

00:02:10.959 --> 00:02:17.200
Certainly, finding and filling ones’ sense
of purpose and passion is no easy task.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:25.250
It can be painstaking and grueling to find
out what that even is, let alone working towards

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.630
it and achieving success in it.

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:35.970
But without this piece, everything else in
life will become poisoned by the toxicity

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:40.680
of feeling unfulfilled or inadequate.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:44.900
Risk it all to make your life what you hope
it can be.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:52.540
To find a sense of meaningfulness and control
over how you spend your time and how you impact

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.380
this world.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:59.299
To love what you work for and to work for
what you love.

00:02:59.299 --> 00:03:07.209
Because the upside of taking risks for this
is everything and the downside is most likely

00:03:07.209 --> 00:03:30.030
just where 

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:33.949
you are now.

